{"type":"message","id":"3a44b7c9","parentId":"15a6f6ca","timestamp":"2026-06-17T05:47:36.979Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec_ts_ZTI0ODMwYTctNWNkNi00MmZlLTk5OGItZWU1MzllNzJiOWMz","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Oh, wait! It returns a 403 Forbidden!\n# Let's think: is it possible that SiteGround returns 403 Forbidden because of something else, or is it because we are using curl?\n# Wait! Let's check if we can make requests with Python using the session we used to solve the captcha!\n# In the Python session, we did a `session.get(url, allow_redirects=True, timeout=30)` after solving.\n# Let's check the status code and text of `sol_r` when we did that in Python!\n# In our solver output, when `sol_r = session.get(sol_url, allow_redirects=True)` completed, it printed:\n# \"Solution response status: 202\"\n# Wait! The status code was 202, and the body was:\n# <html><head><meta http-equiv=\"refresh\" content=\"1;%2F\"><script>var l=window.location;document.cookie=\"_I_=...\";l.href=decodeURIComponent(\"%2F\");</script></head></html>\n# This means:\n# 1. We must execute the Javascript or simulate it by setting the cookie in the session (it set a session cookie via JavaScript: document.cookie=\"_I_=...\").\n# Wait, did python's `session` receive the cookie via `Set-Cookie` header in the HTTP response?\n# Yes! The response had:\n# 'Set-Cookie': '_I_=0559a597c8e1745797ee7e07a7f8552d5ec545bb0c10827e876837738d5e2b8d-1781675249-21; expires=Fri, 17-Jul-26 05:47:29 GMT; max-age=2592000; path=/; domain=.coinography.com; HttpOnly'\n# So requests.Session *did* save that cookie in its cookie jar.\n# But wait! Why does `curl` get a 403 Forbidden when using that cookie?\n# Ah! Let's examine if the cookie we are sending matches EXACTLY.\n# Let's read `/tmp/wp_cookies.txt`!\ncat /tmp/wp_cookies.txt"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","usage":{"input":3844,"output":550,"cacheRead":39632,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":44026,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781675253414,"responseId":"9jQyaqPFEeedrtoPvqjAsQg"}}
