{"type":"message","id":"7f77ea37","parentId":"0d404db0","timestamp":"2026-06-17T07:06:24.286Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"To help you with allowlisting and understanding the VPN behavior, here is exactly what is happening:\n\n### 1. Your Current Public IP Address\nRight now, the public IP address your laptop is using to connect to the internet is:\n**`135.136.39.35`**\n\n*(Note: Earlier in our logs, your IP address was `103.216.221.94` and then `103.216.221.76`. This proves your IP is dynamic.)*\n\n---\n\n### 2. What happens if you turn the VPN off and on?\n**Every time you turn your VPN off and on, your IP address will change.** \n\nHere is why:\n* **When you turn the VPN ON:** The VPN provider connects you to one of their secure servers. They have thousands of servers and IP addresses. Each time you reconnect, the VPN will assign you a **different IP address** from their pool of available IPs.\n* **When you turn the VPN OFF:** Your connection goes back to your local Internet Service Provider (ISP). Your ISP also dynamically assigns IP addresses, which means even without a VPN, your IP can change when your router restarts or lease times expire.\n\n---\n\n### 3. How to keep a static (unchanging) IP address\nIf you want to allowlist a permanent IP address on SiteGround so you never get blocked again, you have two great options:\n\n1. **Get a \"Dedicated IP\" from your VPN provider:** Most major VPNs (like NordVPN, Surfshark, ExpressVPN) allow you to purchase a **Dedicated / Static IP** add-on. This ensures that every time you turn your VPN on, you are guaranteed to have the *exact same* IP address. You can allowlist this on SiteGround once, and it will work forever.\n2. **Set up a Proxy or VPS:** You can route your scripts through a cheap Cloud virtual private server (like a $4/month DigitalOcean droplet) which has a permanent static IP, and allowlist that single IP on SiteGround."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","usage":{"input":95510,"output":662,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":96172,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781679977624,"responseId":"a0cyauGTB9fCvdIP5KGsEA"}}
